      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LEXUS LOU (11) is in fine form having put two wins together at this circuit and distance. Had enough speed to come from this barrier and lead two back before cruising home by more than 10m last time. Expect him to push forward again. Can land the hat trick. A TRUE LOVE (3) has joined Brad Hewitt since coming from wider for a 1.4m second at this circuit and distance last week. That was her fourth placing from her last five starts so her hoof is on the till and she draws well. ANDRETTI (6) has had a stable change since he found winning form at Bathurst last time. Came from wider than this for second the last time he raced here. VAN BASTEN (12) draws wide but should find this easier than the last attempt and won in this grade here prior. MIKI BE GOOD (5) showed improvement in a last-start fourth and draws closer to the pegs.",
